  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Lily is in her bedroom. She has a big bookcase. Her favorite book is on it. It is about fishing. \"Grandpa likes fishing,\" says Lily. \"Today I go with him!\" Mom puts a hat on her head.",
      "Lily and Grandpa go to the pond. Pip comes too. He is a good dog. Grandpa has a big bag. \"Sit here, Lily,\" says Grandpa. \"Don't talk, please.\" \"The fish don't like it.\" \"Don't go in the water, Pip!\" \"It is for the fish.\" Lily holds the line.",
      "Lily looks and looks. Pip sits next to her. \"I have a fish!\" says Lily. \"It is small and gray.\" Grandpa smiles. \"Well done, Lily!\" \"Do you enjoy fishing?\" asks Grandpa. \"Yes, I do!\" says Lily. \"I love it!\" It is a fun day."
    ],
    "summary": "Lily has a favorite book about fishing. She goes fishing with Grandpa and learns the rules at the pond.",
